MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA scores
* Hypothese : H9 structure out.xml : scores predefinis, score FLUX utilisateur, keff par estimateur, tests de normalite (ACTI>=50)
* Attendu    : NORMAL END, scores dans out.xml

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 8.7407
    VOLU 1 0 1 UMET 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
  ENDM

OUTP
  SCOR
    ACTI ALL
    DEFI flux_umet
      RESP FLUX
      EBIN EB3_ICSBEP
      LOCA MEDI_UMET
      ESTI ALL
  ENDS
ENDO

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
